# Shallow Grave: "Return the top creature card of your graveyard to the battlefield." Bot2 Lightning Bolts Bot1's Ornithopter and
# then its Llanowar Elves on turn 2, so the Elves are the top creature card (the Ornithopter is under them). On turn 3 Bot1 casts
# Shallow Grave (Mox Jet and Mox Pearl pay): only the Elves return, with haste until end of turn, and they are exiled at the
# beginning of that turn's end step; the Ornithopter stays in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Llanowar Elves
Shallow Grave
Island
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

